================================================================================
NOTE ON REFERENCE IMAGERY
================================================================================

Images under reference/ are photographs of generic, commodity industrial storage
products used as dimensional reference during modelling. They are included for
that documentary purpose. If you are redistributing this repository and that
matters to you, drop reference/ — nothing in the build depends on it.
